; Compile, link and run hello.c with SAS/C on the a3000-dev machine:
;   uv run amiga-env exec a3000-dev work/hello/test.amigados
; The program's output is left in work/hello/output.txt for the host.
; Which headers and linker library SAS/C will see first: the NDU 3.1
; headers say "Includes Release 40.15", the ones SAS/C shipped say 40.13.
Search INCLUDE:exec/types.h "Includes Release"
CD Work:hello
Delete >NIL: hello hello.o output.txt
sc LINK hello.c
hello >output.txt
Type output.txt
